WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.290
Picture a top surgeon who types
faster than her receptionist.

2
00:00:04.290 --> 00:00:06.530
She is better at both jobs.

3
00:00:06.530 --> 00:00:09.870
Yet she still leaves the
typing to the receptionist.

4
00:00:09.870 --> 00:00:12.210
Countries face the same puzzle.

5
00:00:12.210 --> 00:00:14.690
Why do countries buy from
abroad things they could

6
00:00:14.690 --> 00:00:16.880
make perfectly well at home?

7
00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:20.340
In this mission, you'll find
absolute and comparative advantage

8
00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:23.060
from PPCs and from tables.

9
00:00:23.060 --> 00:00:26.920
Then you'll calculate terms of trade
that leave both countries better off,

10
00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:28.890
and test them in the graph lab.

11
00:00:28.890 --> 00:00:33.360
You'll even see both countries
consume beyond their own PPC.

12
00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:36.720
Your mission: explain why
buying from someone else can

13
00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:38.530
beat doing it all yourself.
